      "id": 483546,
      "username": "peterg",
      "name": "Peter",
      "created_at": "2025-10-09T11:21:23.286Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You can’t share sessions between two sites, but you could set up a single-sign on using OAuth, with <a href=\"http://a.com\">a.com</a> as an identity provider. It’s not a trivial process, but there’s documentation for Frappe and discussion around here.</p>",
